xrdp-console

Copyright (C) 2026 Keivan Moradi

This project contains the first-party direct-X11 xrdp module, deployment
scripts, tests, benchmark harness code, and helper programs. The runtime uses
xrdp and X11 components. FreeRDP and Xvfb are optional test dependencies;
OpenGL and Vulkan are optional diagnostic/benchmark dependencies. Third-party
components remain under their own licenses. The deprecated VNC/RFB benchmark
comparison is not part of the production runtime.
